      "summary": "build_01: Added the root CMake configuration for the isolated Nextafter operator package targeting ascend910b.; build_02: Added the isolated build.sh for the Nextafter Ascend C operator, targeting ascend910b and preserving explicit ST/example installation behavior.; build_03: Stage build_03 adds the Nextafter op_host CMake build wiring for host definition, shape inference, tiling, ACLNN libraries, graph proto generation, and packaging.; build_04: Add the isolated op_kernel CMake build for Nextafter, selecting the arch22 kernel for Ascend910B3 with a safe fallback to the canonical kernel source name.; host_01: Added the Nextafter operator definition with two float32 inputs and one float32 output for Ascend910B3.; host_02: Added Nextafter infer-shape validation for two identical-shape float32 tensor inputs and single identical-shape output; broadcast is explicitly rejected in the bounded candidate scope.; host_03: Generated the arch22 host tiling for Nextafter (float32-only, no-broadcast scope) with platform/shape/dtype validation, workspace declaration, single-parameter tiling-key selection, and OPTILING registration.; kernel_01: Added the arch22 Nextafter kernel entry with template parameters matching the declared tiling key and Init/Process dispatch to the kernel class.; kernel_02: Adds the arch22 Nextafter kernel class with bit-exact float32 nextafter semantics and Init/CopyIn/Compute/CopyOut flow.; kernel_03: Define the authoritative NextafterTilingData schema for arch22 elementwise nextafter tiling.; kernel_04: Added float32-only arch22 tiling-key declarations for Nextafter, covering the dtype template parameter and buffer-mode selection.; api_01: Declares the two-stage ACLNN L2 interface for the float32-only Nextafter operator (stage api_01), with bounded support-scope documentation and no other changes.; api_02: Added ACLNN two-stage L2 API for float32 Nextafter with strict same-shape validation.; api_03: Added the L0 ACLNN header declaring l0op::Nextafter for the float32 registry-invoke operator.; api_04: Added the L0 ACLNN implementation for Nextafter with float32-only checks, shape inference, platform gating, output allocation, and AI Core launch registration.; test_adapter_01: Added NumPy oracle contract tests plus explicitly guarded AsNumpy public API/adapter checks for nextafter.; test_adapter_02: Emit the unverified AsNumpy adapter manifest for nextafter with bounded float32 support, exact numerical policy, explicit rejection rules, and Python/pybind/native/ACLNN name mapping.",
